{"license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Taal in het grensgebied : Westerkwartier in Groningen (1984)"},{"typeName":"alternativeTitle","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Language in borderland : Westerkwartier in Groningen (1984)"]},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P1744"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:30765"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"prof.dr. D. Gorter (Fryske Akademy)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"dr. L.G. Jansma (Fryske Akademy)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"drs. G.H. Jelsma (Fryske Akademy)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P.L.G. van der Meer"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fryske Akademy"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In juni 1984 heeft een zevental onderzoekers gegevens verzameld over de taalsituatie in twee (Groningse) grensgemeenten: Grotegast en Marum. (Die gemeenten zijn drietalig: Fries, Nederlands en Gronings.) Het ging om een inventariserend onderzoek naar taalgebruik en naar de relatieve sterkte van de verschillende taalvarianten. Algemene onderzoeksvraag was daarbij: wie praat welke taal met wie, in welke omstandigheden en waarom?<br><br>This study describes the position of the Frisian language spoken in a small area in the province of Groningen (It Westerkwartier) adjacent to Friesland. The authors compare the position of Frisian to Dutch and a local dialect outside the provincial borders.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Geolinguistics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Language transmission"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Language boundaries"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Language contact"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","Western Frisian"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1984-01-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"drs. P.L.G. van der Meer (documentalist Fryske Akademy)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1984-01-01"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1984-01-01"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Fryske Akademy"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":f